        "notes": "for round two  [Solar Regenergy](item_b03b2c68-d3e3-413a-a9b8-3385149ba9b8)  is absolutely required, this is one of the hero items that makes this build absolutely insane and should be kept until round 7. it wont be doing much for round 2, but round 3 and further itll really start to work\n\nsince orisa has 3 abilities, you should basically be rotating all 3 of them to make sure its constantly activating. \n\nsince youll most likely be able to get another rare item, i like to go with  [Meka Z-Series](item_358d93ab-617b-41e7-8df3-ac78d0d8c680)  if you have enough/doing good, but if theres an ana, rein, sigma, or cass id use  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f)  as it not only heals you for more, but gives you a higher chance of staying alive",
