        "notes": "this is where the build really starts to work, and for that to happen you need to get two things -  [Hooves of Steel](item_ee26ce74-568d-47ed-8dcf-fb5cc0fbac9d) , and  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) \n\nthe enemy team will be shooting you no matter what, which means hooves of steal is going to work. you already have  [Solar Regenergy](item_b03b2c68-d3e3-413a-a9b8-3385149ba9b8)  which regenerates your armor when using an ability, and since armor is first youll basically be constantly regenerating it. paired with  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) and the amount of health you already have, your self heals will be the same amount of damage your dealing! \n\n [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98)  also has 10% cd reduction, which can help you cycle your abilities easier to continue activating  [Solar Regenergy](item_b03b2c68-d3e3-413a-a9b8-3385149ba9b8)",
