        "notes": "for round 4 id take  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d), or  [Efi\u2019s Theorem](item_609c4cb6-a232-4e08-a11f-5252d40382be)  for the 20% ability lifesteal and 50% fortify duration. both of them are fine and will help you with your survivability since youll be keeping these until round 7 anyways\n\nquick note: as the time of writing this, armor and blocking is currently broken (any character with armor and some sort of block, which orisa has, itll be way more dmg reduction instead of orisas original 45% reduc.  [Efi\u2019s Theorem](item_609c4cb6-a232-4e08-a11f-5252d40382be) is basically broken here, but  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) still works well!)",
